Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.21,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:31.76,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.84,0:00:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.06,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.44,0:01:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart was all aflutter\Nwhen I found out Davis'
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.26,0:01:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soccer team was playing against that\Ndreamy superstar Ken with Rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis started off great, but when Ken got\Nin the game, he ran circles around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, Cody discovered another\Ncontrol spire in the Digi-World,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the ground swallowed us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.34,0:01:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Emperor made Davis\Nchoose which one of us would
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.62,0:01:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fed to the Deltamon\Nwhen suddenly we showed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.24,0:01:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Davis realized it was\Njust the Emperor's sick joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found out that my dreamboat\NKen is really the Digimon Emperor!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.68,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\pos(320,323)}Overdrive of the Evil Ring's Magic
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.04,0:02:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could and I am Ken Ichijouji!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken is the Digimon Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one and only, well, Davis,\Nfarewell for now, my worthy adversary,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until we meet again in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.66,0:02:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, the Emperor's not in a good mood\Ntoday, which is like every other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.58,0:02:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can cheer him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ken, did you hear the\None about the man who was...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you heard that one already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, what are you watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Join us as we talk with\Nyoung genius Ken Ichijouji.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just your average boy, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you spend a lot of time studying?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.98,0:02:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some geniuses do, but\NI'd rather play soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:02:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And funny, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say genius is 1 %\Nbrains and 99 % hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that's true?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine's 2%.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.86,0:03:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to think you came from such humble\Nbeginnings in an everyday apartment building.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you glad you're just\Na normal, average kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.66,0:03:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's absolutely nothing\NI love more than being average.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you've mastered chess, 3D chess,\Nand the Donkey Madness video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anything you can't handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reporters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.30,0:03:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The big question on everyone's\Nmind is what does a genius
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.28,0:03:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do for fun when he's not\Nsolving complex math problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I know that math is already\Nmore fun than most people can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.94,0:03:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm always busy writing one of my\Ncomputer programs, but like I said earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.12,0:03:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my favorite thing to do is play soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.98,0:03:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll be a big\Nsuccess at that, too, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see how anything could\Npossibly get in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that about wraps it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your time, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.26,0:03:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best of luck. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That went well, don't you think, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always look good to the press.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That 1%, 2 % stuff was brilliant, although\NI'm not really sure I understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain it to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something else\Nyou can help me with, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you get past level\Nfour on Donkey Madness?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't get the Scepter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you know I wouldn't tell\Nanyone else your gaming secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.60,0:04:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be glad to tell you everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even come over and\Nhelp you play the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is, of course, if you don't think\Nyou're too old to be playing video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, too old.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always forget that I'm an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to get to my\Nadvanced joystick class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, could you do just one\Nlast thing for me, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.02,0:04:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? Um, autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
