Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.01,0:04:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.10,0:04:51.31,autograph,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\frz24.393\pos(228,191)}Yuriko-chan,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.10,0:04:51.31,autograph,,0,0,0,,{\fscx150\fscy150\frz26.232\pos(270,241)}do your best!!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.10,0:04:51.31,autograph,,0,0,0,,{\frz27.509\fscx125\fscy125\pos(413,288)}Ichijouji Ken
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even better than a\Ngraphics accelerator card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.16,0:04:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guys will be jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:04:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can destroy somebody tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ken, honey, your\Ndinner is ready, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, it's getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.36,0:05:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your favorite, dear? Liver\Nsquash and lumpy mashed potatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saw you on the TV today, Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.48,0:05:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon you're gonna need a stick\Nto keep all of the ladies away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just like your old dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've lost my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.92,0:05:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all of those fools out there\NDreaming away their meaningless lives
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Running around like rats in a maze Not one\Nof them is worth half of what I'm worth
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.44,0:05:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing but fools
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master? Master? Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be depressed. I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's grab some Dark Rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.68,0:06:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll capture a couple of innocent Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and make their lives absolutely miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.38,0:06:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Ken is the Digimon Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as Emperor, he's not just a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an evil genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.26,0:06:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a super evil genius at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.60,0:06:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't understand why\Nsuch a talented and smart
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,person would want to use\Ntheir gifts to hurt others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He seems so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, there was a report\Non him on TV yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw it on that show, The Genius Parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the Digimon\NEmperor is a kid like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Find him? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll track him down and confront\Nhim outside the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does his plan include a\Npart where we get to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.00,0:06:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For you, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I wonder where Yo-Li could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late, but look what I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chocolate! Cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could be head chef\Nin the cafeteria one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're not hungry? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised they didn't\Neat my arm right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an article in it about Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you gave me a paper cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's him, the evil kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would think that such a normal-looking\Nboy could be the Digimon Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His smile makes him look so gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, but his haircut\Nmakes him look like you, Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen him on the news before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.48,0:07:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at his IQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could program my computer any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may be smart, but that guy is\Ncompletely rotten to the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he's not just smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:08:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got dash and good looks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's also really athletic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm just as good at\Nsports as that guy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, don't get your\Nknickers in a twist, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.30,0:08:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are knickers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.58,0:08:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use my math program to locate the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,apartment building behind\NKen in this picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like a nice place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if living next to a heartless kid\Nwho wants to rule the world is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my calculations are correct,\Nhe should live right around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know that area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You smudged my screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think there's an apartment building\Nright there under Kari's fingerprint.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, usually I hear the furious\Nscribble of him doing math problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But today, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.24,0:08:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been awfully quiet\Nsince that soccer game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to barge in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might set off one of his booby traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you met with his teacher,\Ndid he say anything at all to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, all his teacher could talk about\Nwas something called donkey madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Donkey madness?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, it's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, we don't even own a donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.54,0:09:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, should we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we break down the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.35,0:09:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't break it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got to break something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.88,Ken's note,,0,0,0,,{\pos(317,233)}I have nothing to do with this world anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.88,Ken's note,,0,0,0,,{\pos(295,290)}Farewell, insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your trivial lives will\Nplague me no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.86,0:09:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My destiny awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the place where we\Nstop Ken once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:09:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I wrote down a battle plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, does it include the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that kid's trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little Ken Ichijouji is missing, and\Nno one has any idea where he might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's run away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away from home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet I know where he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.86,0:10:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just two words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.58,0:10:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken is probably in the digital world,\Nbut it's dangerous to just rush in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.02,0:10:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the longer we wait, the more\Ntime he has to plot against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to make a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to know what Ken's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.14,0:10:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's check the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.90,0:10:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean what I think it means?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.66,0:11:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken is taking over areas in the\Ndigital world faster than ever before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.96,0:11:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to be reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember the expression, fools\Nrush in where angels fear to tread.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.74,0:11:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.41,0:11:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being a fool is really\Nlow on my priority list,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.34,0:11:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't just sit here and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do evil geniuses have to be so evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look capable of\Ncausing such trouble, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he is, and don't\Nlet yourself forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've had enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The clock keeps ticking away\Nand I'm getting ticked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.70,0:11:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want some action.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right, so let's get it into gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.04,0:11:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm with you. Let's fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've convinced me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.14,0:11:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-port, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go get that evil cute guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.76,0:11:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's genius stomping time, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.86,0:12:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this land of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like the movie Land of Fire! I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure is hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five star chili hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.02,0:12:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you let me fight? Instead\Nof capturing Greymon, you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll take that as a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, can I get a little help here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having some trouble standing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That control spire will be their doom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes open\NTrouble could be anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.66,0:12:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meramon are very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can burn you with their roaring\Nflame attack or just by touching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:12:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's show them who's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.64,0:13:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimental Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-mon, armor, digivolts, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conflamedramon, the fire of courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raring flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do that anymore,\Nyou're just tickling him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think fire attacks\Nare going to work on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.05,0:13:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him, Hawkmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.74,0:13:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor ignites!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon, Armor Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.10,0:13:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters,\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.80,0:14:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pulsemon, the wings of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gazimon, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.90,0:14:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making the flames bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.10,0:14:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's my prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say the two of us go at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One-on-one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as I appreciate your offer,\NKoromon, I'd rather we play Sphere Throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I hate Sphere Throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing is working.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.14,0:14:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to you, Armadillo-Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.20,0:14:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor Energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.36,0:14:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, Armor Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.74,0:15:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters!\NDigimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.54,0:15:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, the drill of power! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.48,0:15:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock cracking!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.64,0:15:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing stops him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.86,0:15:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.76,0:15:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon armor energized!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.74,0:15:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon armor digivolves!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon flying high on Tempest Wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.38,0:16:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.04,0:16:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shooting Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi Armor, energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Tailmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor Digivolve, too! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiro Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.86,0:16:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.36,0:16:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sending Greymon to attack\Nthose kids is my best plan yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, uh, what about the\Nproblems you had with Andromon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.40,0:16:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned from my mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.98,0:16:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can make a rookie Digimon\Ndigivolve while under my control,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I can control its\Nother forms as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, you give me chills\Nwhen you act all tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon, digivolve to metal,\NGreymon, and be my slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:17:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.82,0:17:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skull Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.74,0:17:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosetta Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for playing with fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Skull Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing more terrifying than\Nhis looks are his fighting skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially his dark shot attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.88,0:17:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skull? Greymon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, this plan doesn't\Nreally seem so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:17:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we beat that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.96,0:17:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.76,0:18:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.61,0:18:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said we run and then\Nafter that we run some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got Fladramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digmon, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.94,0:18:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piximon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.34,0:18:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.88,0:18:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have to fight Skull Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay clustered together so\Nyou create an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.62,0:18:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.28,0:18:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got good aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should probably put on my goggles!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna play rough?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to find out who he's calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.48,0:19:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, they're Dark Tyranomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A computer program turned Tyranomon\Ninto the evil Dark Tyranomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out for his fire breath attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't we ever fight anything short?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like some mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going way too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.66,0:19:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all that fire, they can\Nbake, broil and freeze him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he can't stand the heat, he\Nbetter get out of the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, you're making me wanna barbecue!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's throwing them around like drag dolls!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.94,0:20:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Painful!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.85,0:20:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope he doesn't get the\Nidea to throw us around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He beats them all single-handed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That slimy creature is coming after him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I say slimy creature, I mean Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon! Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.44,0:20:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better not hurt him, Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From defeat, I snatch another victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.22,0:20:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, somebody do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.20,0:20:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.21,0:20:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the strangest thing I've seen\Nsince my ethernet configuration collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.93,0:20:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire area that Agumon was guarding\Nhas been taken over by the Digimon Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.62,0:20:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean that Agumon\Nis under his control?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or worse yet, what if\NAgumon's been destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.98,0:21:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he was able to get Agumon, that means\Nevery one of our Digimon are in danger!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what to do. Just\Nlook at it. I'm not looking at
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what to do. I'm\Njust thinking. I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.32,0:21:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm not sure. I'm not\Nsure what to do. It's not just
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.77,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.92,0:21:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like I'm not sure. It's a
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.60,0:21:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feeling. I'm not sure. I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.62,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.62,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.34,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.34,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.70,0:22:29.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.02,0:23:02.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fscx110\fscy110\pos(321,328)}The Enemy is MetalGreymon!

